<title>USA: Stein Mart offers 3.85 mln shrs $21.75/shr.</title>
<headline>Stein Mart offers 3.85 mln shrs $21.75/shr.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSONVILLE, Fl. 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stein Mart Inc said on Tuesday that its 3.85 million share public offering was priced at $21.75 per share.</p>
<p>The shares were increased to 3,850,000 from 3,500,000.</p>
<p>The company said the issue is comprised of shares controlled by Jay Stein, and shares beneficially owned by John Williams Jr.</p>
<p>The company would not receive any proceeds from the sale of the shares.</p>
<p>J.C. Bradford &amp; Co served as lead underwriter in the offering.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
